runescape-agent (https://github.com/0x3ddie/runescape-agent)

This repository builds on rs-sdk (https://github.com/MaxBittker/rs-sdk), which
contains the Lost City engine and content:

- The files in vendor-patches/ are patches to rs-sdk. They quote and change lines of
  its source in sdk/, server/engine/ and server/content/.
- sim/ (the Python reference simulator and its C port in sim/native/) reimplements
  the engine's game rules, path finding and content scripts, following that source
  rule by rule and quoting parts of it in comments.
- env-ts/ and sim/extract.ts run inside the engine, call its code and adapt parts of
  it (for example the client's routing and the engine's handlers).

